WEBVTT

00:06.416 --> 00:09.500
[The following program is a true story.]

00:09.583 --> 00:12.333
[At least some of it is... untrue.]

00:12.500 --> 00:14.250
[True.]

00:15.708 --> 00:19.666
[6AM - 12 years ago]

00:23.153 --> 00:24.737
She's kicking again.

00:25.403 --> 00:26.862
Maybe she wants to get out of there

00:27.320 --> 00:29.195
or she hates what I'm doing now.

00:29.847 --> 00:32.077
Do you know how hard it was
for me to do what you asked.

00:32.380 --> 00:34.672
I had to stick my neck out to help you.

00:35.026 --> 00:36.977
But I understand that
you've got your reasons.

00:37.909 --> 00:39.099
Can I feel it a bit?

00:39.322 --> 00:40.372
Be gentle.

00:43.153 --> 00:44.255
Hey Hanh.

00:44.632 --> 00:45.965
It's your Uncle Co.

00:46.550 --> 00:49.622
When you're finally out of
this prison of yours,

00:49.872 --> 00:52.622
don't piss on me when I hold you.

00:53.237 --> 00:56.112
Because I'm the one who helped your Mom...

00:56.979 --> 00:59.420
Buy diapers and milk for you!

00:59.445 --> 01:00.820
Your ancestors!

01:01.112 --> 01:02.028
Enough fun.

01:02.403 --> 01:03.195
Give me the goods.

01:03.445 --> 01:07.262
If you're gonna yell at me, then you better
have a good reason for me to vouch for you.

01:07.531 --> 01:09.270
I'm doing this for the other one.

01:09.903 --> 01:11.110
My older daughter.

01:11.135 --> 01:14.078
I want her to go to the city,
get an education, attend college.

01:14.937 --> 01:16.590
Then six bricks oughta do it.

01:18.059 --> 01:19.375
I'm a parent, too.

01:19.640 --> 01:20.704
Word of advice.

01:20.729 --> 01:24.187
No matter now much you care for them,
when they get old, they'll still hate you.

01:24.325 --> 01:26.818
Fuck you. I don't need to be
lectured by you.

01:27.190 --> 01:28.476
Just get this over with!

01:29.903 --> 01:31.695
No good deed goes unpunished.

01:32.364 --> 01:33.498
You want serious?

01:35.437 --> 01:36.959
If this deal fails,

01:37.273 --> 01:38.861
I'll be executed.

01:38.929 --> 01:40.512
Are you certain that you can sell it all?

01:41.841 --> 01:43.984
Have I ever failed to deliver my word?

01:44.734 --> 01:48.432
Honestly, I can sell these things faster
than selling chicken innards.

01:49.862 --> 01:50.920
I swear.

01:51.487 --> 01:53.760
I'll pay you back every single penny.

01:55.570 --> 01:56.848
You swear?

01:57.737 --> 02:00.613
Would you dare swear on the life
of your daughter?

02:04.057 --> 02:05.305
Motherfucker.

02:05.622 --> 02:07.407
Leave my daughter out of it!

02:10.320 --> 02:11.323
Remember!

02:11.473 --> 02:13.598
You have 12 weeks to pay me back 500 mil.

02:14.723 --> 02:15.807
If you sell out...

02:16.262 --> 02:18.049
You and I can go big business together.

02:21.737 --> 02:24.270
Just wait for my text...
You'll have all of your money.

02:26.270 --> 02:27.629
Game on!

02:36.612 --> 02:40.570
[7PM - 12 years later]

03:02.645 --> 03:05.229
[10AM - New Year's Day]

03:14.083 --> 03:16.803
You would rather pay others
instead of paying me back?

03:16.989 --> 03:19.331
I'm trying to find my daughter, stupid!

03:19.356 --> 03:22.528
Hey there... You better watch
your tone with me.

03:22.627 --> 03:24.502
If you want to see your daughter again!

03:24.981 --> 03:26.103
It was you!

03:26.347 --> 03:27.687
You kidnapped my daughter!

03:27.718 --> 03:30.096
You don't think I'll tell the cops
to haul your ass off!

03:30.121 --> 03:31.147
Tell the cops.

03:31.528 --> 03:35.462
When they come, I'll be sure to mention
the 500mil that you still owe me.

03:35.487 --> 03:38.420
You kidnapped my daughter just
to get me to pay you back, right?

03:38.445 --> 03:42.271
I told you already. It's been 12 years.
I have no money. It is all gone!

03:42.296 --> 03:43.713
I have no money!

03:43.738 --> 03:45.578
Then you have no daughter.

03:45.757 --> 03:48.372
Pay me back
or say goodbye to your daughter.

03:51.195 --> 03:52.450
Co!

03:54.253 --> 03:56.156
Throw away your rice sacks.

03:56.265 --> 03:58.204
This is the new way to transport the goods.

03:58.229 --> 04:00.070
Just tell your suppliers,

04:00.095 --> 04:01.530
give me 200mil,

04:01.555 --> 04:04.678
I can transport 2 containers worth.
Quick. Clean. Immediately.

04:07.570 --> 04:09.695
Get the fuck out of these jungles.

04:12.156 --> 04:13.256
Around here,

04:13.570 --> 04:14.945
who doesn’t use coals?

04:15.395 --> 04:17.632
Cops will never suspect it.
Trust me!

04:17.859 --> 04:18.999
I've tried it!

04:23.039 --> 04:25.265
[12PM - Day 2 Tet]

04:28.174 --> 04:31.170
Why are you using your old number?
Did the cops confiscate your new phone?

04:31.195 --> 04:34.052
I've tried everything,
but I can't get you 500mil.

04:34.077 --> 04:35.753
I'd sell my house,
but it's still not enough.

04:35.778 --> 04:37.172
What should I do now?

04:37.284 --> 04:38.318
300mil.

04:38.343 --> 04:39.070
50.

04:39.112 --> 04:39.737
200!

04:39.903 --> 04:40.719
50!

04:40.744 --> 04:41.804
100. Final offer.

04:41.829 --> 04:42.871
You get your daughter.

04:42.896 --> 04:44.295
I get my life back.

04:44.320 --> 04:45.695
Fine then 100. Then you...

04:53.320 --> 04:54.920
The number you have called...

04:56.778 --> 05:00.320
[7PM - Day 2 Tet]

05:11.570 --> 05:12.573
Pick up, Dan.

05:15.153 --> 05:16.301
Pick up the damn phone, Dan!

05:19.570 --> 05:20.580
Who's there?

05:21.332 --> 05:22.291
Bau!

05:35.445 --> 05:38.570
[9AM - Day 3 Tet]

05:38.599 --> 05:40.124
My daughter is dead.

05:40.149 --> 05:41.939
Fuck the deal we had!

05:42.987 --> 05:43.653
Hoa!

05:44.109 --> 05:45.345
I didn't do it.

05:45.521 --> 05:46.952
Hoa, don't kill me!

05:46.977 --> 05:49.253
It was Dan and his filthy animals.
They did it!

05:49.278 --> 05:51.712
I couldn't stop them!
I didn't kill Mai!

05:51.737 --> 05:53.629
They killed Mai! Hoa!

05:53.653 --> 05:55.687
Don't kill me, Hoa!

05:55.742 --> 05:58.128
We came up together, remember, Hoa!

05:58.161 --> 06:00.926
We came up together!
Don't kill me, Hoa!

06:01.122 --> 06:01.962
You bitch!

06:01.987 --> 06:02.903
Motherfucker!

06:06.112 --> 06:06.862
Hello?

06:10.075 --> 06:11.450
Yes, I can talk. Go on!

06:20.737 --> 06:24.195
Yes! Tomorrow I'll send a driver
to go pick up the goods!

06:26.284 --> 06:27.778
Good. I'll see you tomorrow.

06:37.351 --> 06:39.288
Think you can lock me up, Hoa?

06:40.256 --> 06:41.456
12 Years!

06:41.710 --> 06:45.087
I sat in a prison! You think
you can cage me in my own home?

06:45.112 --> 06:46.720
You think you can hold me in my home?

06:46.806 --> 06:48.104
12 Years!

06:48.341 --> 06:50.712
There's no prison that can hold me!

06:50.801 --> 06:51.910
You hear me, Hoa!

06:52.070 --> 06:54.067
Hoa! You hear me?

06:54.092 --> 06:58.243
12 Years in the slammer!
No prison can ever hold me!

06:58.534 --> 07:01.034
I'm innocent!
I'm innocent!

07:01.612 --> 07:04.737
[8PM - Day 4 Tet]

07:38.153 --> 07:43.445
MISSING: EVE OF TET

07:45.070 --> 07:48.737
Episode 7: The Truth

07:49.612 --> 07:53.362
[10AM - Day 6 Tet]

07:55.760 --> 07:57.282
Why did you try to kill him?

07:58.278 --> 07:59.641
Because you told me...

07:59.666 --> 08:02.387
He's one of the culprits
who killed Mai, right?

08:03.297 --> 08:05.115
You said that you didn't recognize him.

08:05.140 --> 08:06.390
I wasn't lying!

08:06.415 --> 08:08.029
You are the one who lied.

08:08.195 --> 08:11.083
I'm just a mother in pain
because she lost her daughter.

08:11.570 --> 08:13.061
I raised you, Long.

08:13.086 --> 08:15.241
You manipulated me
into doing the wrong thing.

08:15.573 --> 08:17.071
- Auntie.
- What do you want?

08:17.348 --> 08:19.512
Why did you ask me
to identify those felons?

08:19.786 --> 08:22.802
All the while you had suspected Co,
but was too scared to do anything!

08:22.904 --> 08:25.022
So you used your authority...

08:25.484 --> 08:29.235
You set me up and told me
that Co is one of Mai's killers.

08:30.317 --> 08:32.378
You fanned the fire of my rage.

08:32.403 --> 08:34.486
Turned me into a killing beast.

08:34.511 --> 08:35.469
Then what?

08:35.815 --> 08:37.329
You followed me!

08:37.700 --> 08:41.085
And waited until I was about to kill him,
knowing that I would dare kill.

08:41.632 --> 08:43.236
You bring shame to our family!

08:43.261 --> 08:44.875
You are the most worthless cop!

08:49.778 --> 08:51.224
Thanks to Xuan's statement,

08:53.028 --> 08:56.290
these three felons were arrested
for raping Mai.

08:57.528 --> 08:59.812
Their DNA was found on her body.

09:02.483 --> 09:04.409
On the night that she was raped,

09:05.815 --> 09:07.273
these three men...

09:08.153 --> 09:10.451
had visited this man's home.

09:11.909 --> 09:14.205
Police officers also searched Dan's truck.

09:14.776 --> 09:16.246
They found blood stains,

09:19.008 --> 09:20.657
they belonged to Nguyen Chau Bau.

09:21.261 --> 09:23.082
He was the first to be arrested

09:23.999 --> 09:25.406
and confessed.

09:28.695 --> 09:29.931
And yet you knew...

09:30.661 --> 09:32.703
that there were
still other killers out there.

09:36.672 --> 09:38.115
Everything you said turned out to be right.

09:38.570 --> 09:40.445
Police continued to investigate...

09:41.161 --> 09:42.463
We apprehended Dan.

09:44.050 --> 09:46.572
All of the evidence pointed to Dan.

09:47.487 --> 09:49.657
And Dan is the one who actually
did the kidnapping

09:49.778 --> 09:51.237
and also raped Mai.

09:52.338 --> 09:56.165
Then he let the other three raped Mai,
and then killed her afterwards.

10:01.708 --> 10:03.500
And still you were determined,

10:05.291 --> 10:06.933
to kill Co with your own hands.

10:07.744 --> 10:08.744
Why?

10:12.051 --> 10:14.260
You're asking me why?

10:14.987 --> 10:16.500
You'll be convicted

10:17.249 --> 10:19.413
for the attempted murder
of an innocent man.

10:22.195 --> 10:24.403
The courts won't allow that.

10:25.531 --> 10:29.198
And the man you didn't recognize
will testify against you.

10:29.995 --> 10:32.143
And I'll have no other choice,

10:32.168 --> 10:34.001
but put you in prison.

10:35.807 --> 10:37.015
At which time,

10:38.528 --> 10:40.243
Co will walk free.

10:42.015 --> 10:43.942
You're arresting me?

10:45.495 --> 10:48.380
And letting that killer go free?

10:49.636 --> 10:50.723
You...

10:51.695 --> 10:54.862
I am just a person trying to
protect her family.

10:55.507 --> 10:57.882
You are the center link
in this chain of events!

10:59.945 --> 11:01.403
You're still hiding something from me.

11:03.653 --> 11:05.070
By any means,

11:05.778 --> 11:07.320
I will get to the truth,

11:08.163 --> 11:09.621
because I am a police officer.

11:11.112 --> 11:12.589
I will never stop,

11:13.237 --> 11:14.903
because I am Mai's brother.

11:15.778 --> 11:18.403
I'm did everything here... For Mai.

11:18.903 --> 11:20.425
For my little sister.

11:21.403 --> 11:22.862
Not for you.

11:24.737 --> 11:27.570
You have never been a parent.

11:28.137 --> 11:30.993
You've never known how it feels

11:31.052 --> 11:34.278
to hold your child in your arms
and watch them grow.

11:35.070 --> 11:37.403
Until the day that your own child...

11:37.807 --> 11:41.182
is assaulted to the brink of death,

11:42.320 --> 11:44.320
a victim of true savagery,

11:44.775 --> 11:48.066
then will you know how I feel right now.

11:48.824 --> 11:51.366
When that happens, try to talk
to me about guilt.

11:53.153 --> 11:55.403
If you let Co get away...

11:56.695 --> 11:59.070
then you are the only who is guilty.

12:11.684 --> 12:12.768
Yes, Uncle.

12:15.223 --> 12:16.265
Yes, she is.

12:19.112 --> 12:19.930
Yes.

12:24.841 --> 12:27.237
Can I go see my daughter now?

12:35.698 --> 12:37.259
She looks terrible.

12:37.781 --> 12:40.152
Why did they make her up like that?

12:42.018 --> 12:45.642
At least Mai looks at peace now.

12:46.239 --> 12:47.731
At peace?

12:47.965 --> 12:51.073
You think that she can be at peace
when her killer is still out there?

12:57.078 --> 12:58.870
Why did Long arrest you?

13:00.966 --> 13:02.925
He's trying to pin the guilt on me

13:03.320 --> 13:05.070
instead of trying to catch the killer!

13:06.195 --> 13:07.778
You lied to me again.

13:08.953 --> 13:11.420
You're probably hiding something.
That's why Long wants to arrest you, right?

13:11.445 --> 13:12.028
No.

13:12.973 --> 13:14.386
You're just like Long.

13:14.737 --> 13:16.070
Stumbling idiots!

13:29.398 --> 13:31.719
You found my old phone.

13:32.097 --> 13:34.222
- After the police confiscated my phone...
- That's enough!

13:38.890 --> 13:40.515
Hanh already told me everything.

13:43.070 --> 13:44.987
She showed me your text messages.

13:45.903 --> 13:47.903
The arrangements you had with Co.

13:51.403 --> 13:53.820
How could you do this to me and our family?

13:55.534 --> 13:57.497
You deal drugs to the junkies.

13:58.526 --> 14:00.670
Is the life we have not
good enough for you?

14:00.695 --> 14:01.903
Good enough? In what way?

14:02.344 --> 14:04.290
Everyday in this broke-ass village,

14:04.315 --> 14:06.649
is like an eternity in hell!

14:08.430 --> 14:09.789
And what about you?

14:09.901 --> 14:11.859
Are you so dumb that you don't see that?

14:12.403 --> 14:13.931
All you do is play safe.

14:14.570 --> 14:17.339
I want much more than this from life.

14:19.070 --> 14:21.192
You have taken everything from me.

14:21.217 --> 14:22.424
You're an alcoholic!

14:22.449 --> 14:24.792
You're useless. You ruin everything!

14:25.757 --> 14:27.045
I swear to you.

14:27.070 --> 14:30.445
On my own life, I will never let
our girls end up like me!

14:31.362 --> 14:33.870
I want a much better life for them!

14:34.794 --> 14:36.602
Mai should have been in the city.

14:36.627 --> 14:38.164
Get a proper education.

14:38.848 --> 14:40.004
And then...

14:40.356 --> 14:42.435
She was going to meet a smart man,

14:42.605 --> 14:43.616
successful,

14:43.641 --> 14:45.069
who would marry her.

14:45.760 --> 14:48.056
The farther she is from here, the better.

14:48.809 --> 14:50.998
But how would any of that happen?

14:51.145 --> 14:53.752
You think the money we make from
selling chickens can do that?

14:54.169 --> 14:55.651
And what did you do?

14:55.942 --> 14:59.231
Why would you bring her back to
to live in this hell-hole town?

15:00.112 --> 15:00.929
Huh?

15:02.167 --> 15:05.070
You, with your helpless child look.

15:06.718 --> 15:10.964
I only wished that Mai had been able
to see you for the weak man you are.

15:14.927 --> 15:16.133
She saw.

15:16.784 --> 15:18.327
She knew everything.

15:19.742 --> 15:22.498
She knows you more than you know yourself.

15:24.221 --> 15:25.887
Still she loved you.

15:27.237 --> 15:28.820
Because you are her mother.

15:30.177 --> 15:33.573
That's why she confided in you
about her pregnancy.

15:36.979 --> 15:38.407
She needed you.

15:38.974 --> 15:40.724
She needed her mother.

15:43.024 --> 15:44.396
But then you...

15:46.487 --> 15:51.876
You valued your secrets and all
your lies above your own family.

15:53.862 --> 15:56.245
Why aren't you brave enough
to face the truth?

16:02.153 --> 16:03.965
Truth only brings pain.

16:05.596 --> 16:08.480
I didn't want the kids to suffer

16:08.505 --> 16:12.498
to know the truth of
what I had to do to protect them!

16:15.889 --> 16:18.056
And you think it's better...

16:20.386 --> 16:22.062
To hide the truth...

16:22.878 --> 16:24.294
And continue to lie?

16:26.375 --> 16:28.171
You've taught our daughters...

16:29.320 --> 16:30.362
To tell lies.

16:31.229 --> 16:33.979
To hide away the truth, just like you.
Is that right?

16:39.409 --> 16:40.562
Have you ever thought...

16:41.003 --> 16:42.821
About these ugly things you do,

16:44.372 --> 16:46.789
and the effects they will have on our kids?

16:48.159 --> 16:48.994
Huh?

16:50.445 --> 16:51.409
Here!

16:52.260 --> 16:53.635
Just look at Mai!

16:54.094 --> 16:58.050
This is the result of all your secrets
and your lies!

17:04.987 --> 17:05.987
For God's sake...

17:09.112 --> 17:12.136
Why won't you look at your daughter?
She's laying right here!

17:12.510 --> 17:13.725
Look at her!

17:13.750 --> 17:15.750
Stop putting the blame on others.

17:27.283 --> 17:30.533
You want to know...
Who did this to our daughter?

17:32.737 --> 17:33.778
We did!

17:34.102 --> 17:36.253
You and I, we are the ones
who did this to her!

17:37.658 --> 17:40.980
Our frailties killed our daughter.

17:51.695 --> 17:53.339
Today is the last day.

17:55.075 --> 17:57.785
That we will ever get to see
our daughter's face.

18:01.516 --> 18:03.908
Her face is so beautiful.

18:06.955 --> 18:10.217
You and I owe our daughter
an apology.

18:29.166 --> 18:30.749
I won't report you.

18:33.557 --> 18:35.742
Long does not know about this phone.

18:37.091 --> 18:40.235
You can either erase everything on it,

18:42.823 --> 18:45.829
and continue your life of freedom and lies.

18:48.564 --> 18:49.718
Or if you...

18:50.473 --> 18:53.640
truly believe in getting justice for Mai,

18:55.455 --> 18:57.253
then this is your last chance.

19:09.870 --> 19:11.147
You should know.

19:13.482 --> 19:14.982
Everyone lies.

19:16.528 --> 19:19.901
But the difference...
Between a good person and a bad one,

19:21.179 --> 19:24.554
is that a good person...
Knows when to face the truth.

20:07.765 --> 20:08.754
Mai.

20:09.125 --> 20:09.917
Wake up.

20:12.029 --> 20:13.425
Why are you sleeping at this hour?

20:13.450 --> 20:14.753
[4:30PM - 1 day before Tet]

20:15.153 --> 20:16.014
Mai!

20:19.195 --> 20:20.455
Sorry, Mom.

20:22.168 --> 20:24.543
I waited for you so long,
I must have passed out.

20:25.737 --> 20:26.903
I was busy.

20:30.372 --> 20:32.322
You're not going to tell me, are you?

20:33.359 --> 20:34.342
Tell you what?

20:35.820 --> 20:36.874
Tell...

20:37.903 --> 20:39.778
The truth about what happened.

20:41.632 --> 20:43.606
You've been busy all week.

20:44.081 --> 20:46.706
You have no time to sit down
properly with me to talk.

20:49.403 --> 20:50.585
What about you?

20:51.445 --> 20:53.041
What's so important with you?

20:59.617 --> 21:01.019
You're pregnant, right?

21:03.203 --> 21:06.126
I'm your mother.
I know everything.

21:15.909 --> 21:16.673
No!

21:17.659 --> 21:20.348
You're aborting it.
I won't let you keep it.

21:22.386 --> 21:23.410
Why not?

21:24.523 --> 21:26.606
- Mom, I'm ready...
- Ready to do what?

21:26.903 --> 21:28.179
Ready to be a mother?

21:28.419 --> 21:30.283
Ready to bury your own life?

21:30.308 --> 21:32.304
Ready to give your entire life
to someone else?

21:32.329 --> 21:34.362
Can you put your child above
everything else?

21:34.737 --> 21:35.320
Huh?

21:35.465 --> 21:38.587
Can live with the fear that everything
you've done is not enough?

21:38.612 --> 21:40.166
Because you are not good enough!

21:40.298 --> 21:43.515
When your child is thin and sick,
and you have no way to get money.

21:43.598 --> 21:45.747
How will you take care of
your child then when they are sick?

21:47.023 --> 21:49.399
What will you do to make enough
money to take care of your children?

21:49.570 --> 21:50.319
Huh?

21:50.996 --> 21:53.599
Or having to stay up
each night watching your kid,

21:53.632 --> 21:55.292
or worried that
someone will harm them.

21:55.750 --> 21:57.472
Or that you have harmed yourself!

21:58.325 --> 22:01.174
When you accidentally get knocked up,
and ruined your own life!

22:01.526 --> 22:04.087
I haven't ruined my entire life.

22:04.112 --> 22:05.362
Why are you so stupid?

22:06.923 --> 22:09.060
Who would marry a knocked up girl?

22:10.628 --> 22:14.097
How do you ever...
Expect to get of this area?

22:15.653 --> 22:16.983
What's wrong with living here?

22:18.909 --> 22:20.930
I can live here peacefully.

22:21.160 --> 22:24.194
I want to live with Hanh.
I want to live with you.

22:25.198 --> 22:26.870
I can help take care of Dad.

22:26.895 --> 22:29.487
- Of the family business...
- What family business?

22:30.377 --> 22:32.295
Do you know what I do?

22:32.320 --> 22:32.903
No.

22:34.153 --> 22:35.112
I don't know.

22:35.695 --> 22:36.945
I don't know anything...

22:37.768 --> 22:39.809
When have you ever confided in me?

22:40.020 --> 22:42.180
When have we ever had a heart to heart?

22:42.205 --> 22:44.637
When have you ever shared
anything with anyone?

22:46.074 --> 22:47.632
All that you do is yell.

22:49.143 --> 22:50.591
You scream and you busy.

22:51.403 --> 22:52.820
You do whatever you want.

22:55.362 --> 22:56.487
Do you know...

22:57.518 --> 23:00.032
How terrified this family is of you?

23:03.422 --> 23:05.005
At first, I only planned to come back,

23:07.771 --> 23:09.313
to get an abortion,

23:10.320 --> 23:12.010
and return to school in the city.

23:14.390 --> 23:15.649
And you know what happened?

23:16.528 --> 23:20.487
I came back and saw that no one was taking
care of Dad, no one taking care of Hanh!

23:21.372 --> 23:23.789
My little sister has picked up
so many bad habits. Can't you see?

23:24.231 --> 23:25.417
Haven't you noticed?

23:28.533 --> 23:30.147
She is starting to yell at others.

23:30.353 --> 23:32.594
Every word out of her
mouth is money, money!

23:32.750 --> 23:34.833
She's becoming exactly like you!

23:35.950 --> 23:40.242
- I came back to protect them from you...
- Shut your mouth!

23:51.729 --> 23:52.839
After Tet,

23:53.849 --> 23:56.558
I don't want to see your face
in this house again.

23:58.269 --> 23:59.889
You will get an abortion.

24:00.281 --> 24:02.114
You will go back to school.

24:03.895 --> 24:05.770
And if you don't do as I say,

24:06.695 --> 24:08.778
then you are not my daughter.

24:09.737 --> 24:11.112
It's as if you were dead.

24:12.416 --> 24:14.049
And you will have deserved it.

24:23.292 --> 24:25.377
You don't mean that, right, mother?

24:28.695 --> 24:30.118
Right, Mom?

24:35.497 --> 24:36.331
Mom?

24:41.278 --> 24:42.195
Mommy...

24:44.531 --> 24:45.633
Mom.

25:16.766 --> 25:17.813
Honey...

25:19.987 --> 25:21.918
I didn't mean it...

25:25.387 --> 25:27.761
Truth is, I didn't mean it.

25:33.583 --> 25:34.875
I was wrong.

25:36.153 --> 25:37.278
I'm sorry, honey.

25:39.362 --> 25:40.961
You can do whatever you want.

25:42.278 --> 25:43.695
I didn't mean it.

25:44.737 --> 25:47.269
I really didn't mean it.

26:07.688 --> 26:09.883
I'm looking at you, Mai.

26:09.908 --> 26:14.407
I'm looking at you.
I didn't mean it, Mai.

27:04.362 --> 27:10.628
I didn't kill anyone. I didn't kill anyone!

28:21.487 --> 28:25.112
[4PM - 1 year later]

28:36.278 --> 28:37.195
What's wrong, honey?

28:40.711 --> 28:42.211
Your mother didn't mean that.

28:44.042 --> 28:45.958
We can still come visit her.

28:48.406 --> 28:50.739
Listen to me.
Now let's go home, okay?

28:58.367 --> 28:59.920
How was school today?

28:59.945 --> 29:03.087
It was good. We had biology today!

29:03.112 --> 29:05.438
We even got to operate on a frog!

29:06.449 --> 29:08.005
You're not scared to cut open a frog?

29:08.191 --> 29:09.234
Not at all.

29:09.356 --> 29:10.822
My teacher did it.

29:11.237 --> 29:15.278
The frog's arms and legs
were spread out like this.

29:18.034 --> 29:20.750
Sony was so scared,
she threw up everywhere.

29:20.800 --> 29:21.805
Sony?

29:22.153 --> 29:24.170
Sony is my friend.

29:24.195 --> 29:26.167
Her real name is Anh Thu.

29:26.945 --> 29:34.901
But because she likes to wear these
ginormous headphones, so we call her Sony.

29:52.294 --> 29:54.086
What happened to your face?

30:03.270 --> 30:04.175
Hanh...

30:05.502 --> 30:07.008
Can you wait outside?

30:08.141 --> 30:10.187
I need to talk with your father
privately for a bit...

31:17.903 --> 31:18.836
Father...

31:20.612 --> 31:22.082
From now on...

31:22.979 --> 31:24.979
Don't ever bring Hanh here again.

31:27.219 --> 31:29.199
You also don't have to come visit.

31:31.870 --> 31:32.880
Why?

31:34.403 --> 31:36.611
What if Hanh wants to know
how you are doing?

31:39.297 --> 31:40.147
No.

31:42.320 --> 31:44.550
I don't Hanh to see me like this.

31:47.187 --> 31:48.482
What now?

31:49.791 --> 31:50.996
You're in here.

31:52.408 --> 31:55.591
If she misses you, then what's wrong
with letting her come here to see you?

31:57.643 --> 31:59.351
You're not in here forever.

32:03.286 --> 32:05.727
This investigation is still not over.

32:07.644 --> 32:10.382
Long still blames me for Mai's death.

32:20.750 --> 32:22.287
And what about you?

32:23.487 --> 32:24.310
Huh?

32:48.968 --> 32:50.505
Please, Father.

32:51.698 --> 32:57.839
I don't want Hanh to remember me like this.

33:29.151 --> 33:32.080
After visiting Mom, this time,
how do you feel?

33:34.549 --> 33:36.215
Why do you ask me this every time?

33:38.737 --> 33:43.059
Because every time I ask you,
you say that you're okay.

33:43.127 --> 33:45.598
But then your face is always sad.

33:49.879 --> 33:51.120
Don't worry about me.

33:53.403 --> 33:54.570
So how do you feel?

33:59.421 --> 34:00.938
I miss your sister Mai.

34:14.195 --> 34:15.113
Dad.

34:16.768 --> 34:18.476
Let's take a selfie.

34:32.851 --> 34:33.746
Dad.

34:33.771 --> 34:35.169
Where are you looking?

34:38.245 --> 34:39.703
Look this way, Dad.

34:46.258 --> 34:47.133
Wait!

34:51.070 --> 34:51.910
What's this?

34:51.935 --> 34:55.746
I'm tying it up, so that
you can look as pretty as me.

34:59.278 --> 35:01.237
- Pretty now?
- Pretty!

35:03.278 --> 35:04.653
Hey, that is pretty!

35:12.653 --> 35:13.465
Dad...

35:13.836 --> 35:15.873
That costs 20,000 VND.

35:16.195 --> 35:17.128
Why so expensive?

35:17.153 --> 35:18.587
It should only cost 10,000.

35:18.612 --> 35:19.903
You cann't overcharge me like that!

35:21.320 --> 35:23.503
I know... But...

35:23.528 --> 35:26.737
From now on, you need to love
Mai and I twice as much.

35:27.200 --> 35:28.764
Okay. Fine, then.

35:29.192 --> 35:32.150
But next time I buy five,
you need to give me one free.

35:32.237 --> 35:34.460
No way, then I'd lose money!

35:35.028 --> 35:36.068
Let's keep going.

35:40.863 --> 35:42.000
Yeah.

35:43.151 --> 35:44.503
20k.

35:44.528 --> 35:45.316
40k...

35:46.028 --> 35:47.190
60k.

35:47.215 --> 35:49.090
- Hey that's too much!
- 80k!

35:49.115 --> 35:51.549
- I want a discount!
- 100k!

35:53.026 --> 35:57.359
If I can get a good photo,
then I'll give you a discount.

35:57.896 --> 36:00.429
And remember, buy 5 get 1 free.

36:00.454 --> 36:02.567
MISSING: EVE OF TET
